## People over promos

Downey Nissan serves a bilingual community, and people buy cars from people they trust. The goal was simple: make the sales team, the service techs, and the GM familiar faces before anyone walks onto the lot.

## Two shoot days, a month of content

We shoot two full days a month and turn them into 30 pieces of content across Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, and YouTube. Staff skits, on-the-spot FAQs, a GM who switches languages mid-sentence, and a mystery button nobody should press. Every month we also produce two commercials, each in English and Spanish.

## What the numbers say

One video passed 600,000 views in a day. Staff and humor reels reach about four and a half times as many people as straight promo posts, and Facebook views kept climbing month over month. The dealership's favorite feedback so far: the latest commercials were their funniest yet.
